	(text "PT1000:  \n  0C 1000Ω\n 25C 1097Ω\n 50C 1194Ω\n 75C 1290Ω\n100C 1385Ω\n125C 1480Ω\n150C 1573Ω\n175C 1666Ω\n200C 1759Ω\n\nabout resistance (Ω) = 3.795 * temperature (°C) + 1000\n\npull up resistance: 2.2k => at 200C max diveded votage = 3.3V * (1759/(2k2+1759))  < 1.65 V"
